2026-11-06T03:00:48.8382888Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8490836Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8502098Z [0m
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8502881Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8503756Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8504216Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8504600Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8505535Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8506141Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8506520Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8507234Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8507771Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8508951Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8510065Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8510640Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8511240Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8511440Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8511650Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8511940Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8512275Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8512712Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8512862Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8512986Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8513211Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8516974Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8517865Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8526292Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8526696Z I will:
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8527032Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8527345Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8528369Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8529112Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8529592Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8529914Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8530228Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8530671Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8531070Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8544065Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8544931Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8556238Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8556959Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:00:48.8557462Z 
